heb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> express <highlight>groan</highlight> (i.e. <bdbheb>נֶאֱנַחְתְּ</bdbheb>), which is favoured by context, and adopted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup> and others <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <highlight>make gracious, favourable</highlight> <bdbheb>כִּייְֿחַנֵּן קוֺלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 26:25\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,25)\">Prov 26:25</ref>. <b>Poe`l</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <highlight>direct favour to</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:55»§ 55</sup>, 1) <bdbheb>וְאֶתעֲֿפָרָהּ יְחֹנֵנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 102:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,15)\">Ps 102:15</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְחוֺנֵן עֲנָיִ֯ים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,21)\">Prov 14:21</ref>. <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יֻחַן</bdbheb> <highlight>be shewn favour, consideration</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,10)\">Isa 26:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 21:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,10)\">Prov 21:10</ref>. <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִתְחַנַּנְתָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 9:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,9,3)\">1Kgs 9:3</ref> + 5 t. Perfect; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיִּתְחַנֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,13)\">2Kgs 1:13</ref> <bdbheb>וַתִּתְחַנֶּןֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 8:3\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,3)\">Esth 8:3</ref> <bdbheb>אֶתְחַנָּ֑ן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 30:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,30,9)\">Ps 30:9</ref> + etc. + 6 t. Imperfect; <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>לְהִתְחֶנֶּןֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 4:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,8)\">Esth 4:8</ref> <bdbheb>בְּהִתְחַנְנוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,21)\">Gen 42:21</ref> — <highlight>seek or implore favour:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>of man</highlight>, with <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,21)\">Gen 42:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,13)\">2Kgs 1:13</ref> with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 19:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,16)\">Job 19:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 4:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,8)\">Esth 4:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:3\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,3)\">Esth 8:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of <highlight>God</highlight>, with <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 3:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,23)\">Deut 3:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:33\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,33)\">1Kgs 8:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:47\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,47)\">1Kgs 8:47</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:37\" b=\"14\" c